# head/adult/youth/nose_long: the youth's long nose (boys)
# P2b FACES (wave 2): GENERATED from the adult maps by the FACES spec (the boy = the man's views, the girl = the
# woman's as `when girl replace`); edit the adult maps, then regenerate. Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body youth
role nose long
layer face
anchor head
keys rest

view D key rest origin -8 -9
|r
|r
|r

view U key rest origin 0 0
|.

view R key rest origin -14 -9
|tq.
|ssq
|rsq

view L key rest origin 1 -9
|.qt
|qss
|qss

view D key rest origin -8 -10 when boy,elf replace
|r
|r

view R key rest origin -14 -9 when boy,elf replace
|tq
|sq

view L key rest origin 0 -9 when boy,elf replace
|qu
|qs
